    "detailed_description": "Decypher offers a thrilling experience of deciphering hidden codes. Alongside the standard rule, the game introduces an array of exciting variants and a wide range of levels to keep you engaged.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Code cracking: You are challenged to unravel a series of hidden digits by analyzing clues.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Variant rules: Decypher introduces a captivating range of variant rules to keep you engaged.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tons of levels: Dive into numerous predefined levels, each offering its own unique challenge. From beginner-friendly puzzles to mind-boggling tests of logic, Decypher has something for everyone.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Note taking: Use built-in coloring and drawing functions to eliminate incorrect options or highlight important clues</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Error highlight: If the player inputs a wrong answer, the violated rows will be highlighted to provide immediate feedback and aid in identifying the mistake.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every puzzle in Decypher is carefully designed to ensure that it has one and only one unique solution.</li></ul><br>With its addictive game modes and a variety of levels, Decypher promises endless hours of code-cracking entertainment. Sharpen your mind, embrace the challenge, and become the ultimate code-breaker in Decypher!<br><br>Play now and embark on an exciting journey of decryption mastery. Can you crack the code?",
